<navigation-bar title="登录注册" back="{{true}}" color="#153f36" background="#f7fbf8"></navigation-bar>
<scroll-view class="page-scroll" scroll-y type="list">
  <view class="page-shell auth-page">
    <view class="auth-hero">
      <image class="auth-logo" src="/assets/logo.png" mode="aspectFit"></image>
      <view>
        <view class="auth-title">手机号登录</view>
        <view class="auth-desc">中介输入手机号即可登录；新手机号会自动创建中介账号。</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="mode-switch">
      <button class="{{mode === 'login' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-mode="login" bindtap="switchMode">手机号登录</button>
      <button class="{{mode === 'register' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-mode="register" bindtap="switchMode">员工注册</button>
    </view>

    <view class="auth-card soft-card">
      <view wx:if="{{mode === 'register'}}" class="field">
        <view class="label">真实姓名</view>
        <input value="{{form.name}}" data-field="name" bindinput="updateField" placeholder="请输入员工姓名" />
      </view>
      <view class="field">
        <view class="label">手机号</view>
        <input value="{{form.phone}}" data-field="phone" bindinput="updateField" type="number" maxlength="11" placeholder="请输入 11 位手机号" />
      </view>
      <button class="submit-button" loading="{{submitting}}" disabled="{{submitting}}" bindtap="submit">
        {{mode === 'register' ? '注册员工账号' : '登录 / 创建中介账号'}}
      </button>
    </view>

    <view class="auth-note">
      中介每天可查看 3 套业主房源、15 套普通房源的地址和房东电话，超出后请联系管理员帮忙联系房东。
    </view>
  </view>
</scroll-view>
